  "metaDescription": "Police in NTT are investigating rape allegations against Kupang Regent Yosef Lede, with authorities currently awaiting a scheduled interrogation session.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Police have obtained medical exam results from the victim, a 21-year-old student currently receiving support from LPSK.",
    "The Kupang Regent requested a delay for his scheduled police interrogation until Saturday.",
    "Investigators have questioned several individuals, including Satpol PP personnel and a witness, while seizing evidence linked to the case."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The East Nusa Tenggara (NTT) Regional Police are actively investigating rape allegations involving Kupang Regent Yosef Lede. Authorities have collected medical evidence from the victim, who is a 21-year-old university student. The victim is currently receiving trauma support and assistance from the Witness and Victim Protection Agency (LPSK). As part of the inquiry, law enforcement officials have conducted interrogations of multiple witnesses, including Satpol PP members and individuals present during the incident. While the regional governor has voiced support for a thorough police investigation, the scheduled questioning of the Regent has been postponed at his request until the coming Saturday. Human rights officials have publicly urged the police to accelerate the legal proceedings regarding these allegations, which are being processed under regulations concerning sexual violence.",
